TD_HTML='<nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="../">Home</a> &gt; <span>Trend Data</span></nav><h1>📊 Trend Data packages</h1><p>Every day we research what is about to trend in the US and publish it with sources. Trend Data turns that work into lists, calendars and feeds your team can plan around. Start with a free sample, then choose the package that fits.</p>'
